---

<section class="px-5 pb-24 pt-8 md:px-8">
	<div
		class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-brand-orange/30 bg-ink-soft/80 px-6 py-14 text-center md:px-12"
	>
		<div
			class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-20 -top-20 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-brand-orange/25 blur-3xl"
			aria-hidden="true"
		>
		</div>
		<div
			class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -right-16 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/30 blur-3xl"
			aria-hidden="true"
		>
		</div>
		<h2 class="relative text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">¿Hablamos de tu negocio?</h2>
		<p class="relative mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-zinc-300">
			Cuéntanos qué quieres automatizar, posicionar o crear (web y panel incluidos) y te contactamos para estudiar tu caso, sin compromiso.
		</p>
		<a
			href="/contacto"
			class="relative mt-8 inline-block rounded-lg border border-brand-orange/60 bg-black px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-[0_0_30px_-8px_var(--color-brand-orange)] transition hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-4px_var(--color-brand-orange)]"
		>
			Solicitar información &#10022;
		</a>
	</div>
</section>
